10. Outlier Detection (IQR Method)
salary=c(
50000,
60000,
55000,
80000,
40000,
60000,
70000
)

Q1=quantile(salary,0.25)

Q3=quantile(salary,0.75)

IQR=Q3-Q1

lower=Q1-1.5*IQR

upper=Q3+1.5*IQR

outliers=
salary[
salary<lower |
salary>upper
]

print(outliers)
